      "body": "Adds Muse Spark to the RL model support table in `torchtitan/rl/README.md`.\n\nMuse Spark runs end to end in TitanRL: the DAPO-Math GB300 recipe (`muse_spark_816b_a42b_dapo_math_gb300_config`, #5581) and the Muse Spark 816B SWE-rebench RL smoke on GB300 described there.\n\nThe row says \"text only\", as for Qwen 3.5: the generator's vLLM model wrapper sets `supports_multimodal = False` and drops the vision encoder (`torchtitan/rl/generator/vllm/model_wrapper.py`), so RL rollouts are text even though the model has vision and audio encoders.\n",
